WEBVTT

00:14:29.196 --> 00:14:32.876
but ask yourself:
What are you longing for?

00:14:32.876 --> 00:14:36.116
And follow your longing
where it's telling you to go.

00:14:36.156 --> 00:14:39.396
It's pointing you
in the direction of the sacred.

00:14:39.436 --> 00:14:42.076
If you don't like
that word sacred, I get it,

00:14:42.116 --> 00:14:44.036
call it the wondrous instead.

00:14:46.196 --> 00:14:49.596
You don't, you absolutely
don't have to believe

00:14:49.596 --> 00:14:51.316
in the deities of the ancient books

00:14:51.356 --> 00:14:53.476
to know that spiritual longing is real,

00:14:53.516 --> 00:14:56.836
and that humanity
is steeped in the sublime.

00:14:56.836 --> 00:14:59.996
Once you look, you will see it
everywhere around you.